Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 07:27:51 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 05/13] FeatureGate: internal API and enforcer framework

- FeatureGateInternal published via publishLocalService for in-process
  callers (preventive hooks); mLock is a leaf lock, so it is safe to call
  with other locks held.
- FeatureEnforcer interface; one enforcer per feature, checked at boot.
- Flips are dispatched to enforcers on the service thread, outside the
  lock, with per-enforcer exception isolation.
- dumpsys shows the enforcer mapping; cmd internal-check tests the
  LocalServices path.

Change-Id: Ie268fdb6e083a57dbd38d41d43c6b1ac8b264265
